{"v":1,"book":"Jer","ch":18,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"The word which came to Jeremiah from Jehovah, saying,","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[0]},{"t":" which came to "},{"t":"Jeremiah","s":["H3414"],"a":[4]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[7]},{"t":","}]},{"n":2,"text":"Arise and go down to the potter’s house, and there I will let you hear My words.","tok":[{"t":"Arise","s":["H6965"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and go "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"potter’s","s":["H3335"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and there I will let you "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[5]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"So I went down to the potter’s house, and he was there doing work at his wheel.","tok":[{"t":"So I went "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"potter’s","s":["H3335"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and he was there doing "},{"t":"work","s":["H4399"],"a":[5]},{"t":" at his "},{"t":"wheel","s":["H0070"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"But the vessel that he was making of clay was spoiled in the potter’s hand; so he reworked it into another vessel, as it seemed good for the potter to make.","tok":[{"t":"But the "},{"t":"vessel","s":["H3627"],"a":[1]},{"t":" that he was making of "},{"t":"clay","s":["H2563"],"a":[5]},{"t":" was spoiled in the potter’s "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; so he reworked it into "},{"t":"another","s":["H0312"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"vessel","s":["H3627"],"a":[10]},{"t":", as it "},{"t":"seemed","s":["H5869"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H3474"],"a":[13]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"potter","s":["H3335"],"a":[15]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"make","s":["H6213"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And the word of Jehovah came to me, saying,","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" came to me, "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":","}]},{"n":6,"text":"Am I not able to do with you, O house of Israel, as this potter does? declares Jehovah. Indeed, as the clay is in the hand of the potter, so you are in My hand, O house of Israel.","tok":[{"t":"Am I not able to "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[4]},{"t":" with you, O "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[7]},{"t":", as this "},{"t":"potter","s":["H3335"],"a":[0]},{"t":" does? declares "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":". Indeed, as the "},{"t":"clay","s":["H2563"],"a":[11]},{"t":" is in the "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of the potter, so you are in My "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[16]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"At the moment that I speak about a nation or about a kingdom, to pluck it up or to break it down or to destroy it,","tok":[{"t":"At the moment that I "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[1]},{"t":" about a "},{"t":"nation","s":["H1471"],"a":[3]},{"t":" or about a "},{"t":"kingdom","s":["H4467"],"a":[5]},{"t":", to pluck it "},{"t":"up","s":["H5428"],"a":[6]},{"t":" or to break it "},{"t":"down","s":["H5422"],"a":[7]},{"t":" or to "},{"t":"destroy","s":["H0006"],"a":[8]},{"t":" it,"}]},{"n":8,"text":"And if that nation concerning which I have spoken turns from its evil, I will repent of the evil that I intended to do to it.","tok":[{"t":"And if that "},{"t":"nation","s":["H1471"],"a":[1]},{"t":" concerning which I have spoken "},{"t":"turns","s":["H7725"],"a":[0]},{"t":" from its "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[3]},{"t":", I will "},{"t":"repent","s":["H5162"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[9]},{"t":" that I intended to "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[12]},{"t":" to it."}]},{"n":9,"text":"And at the moment that I speak about a nation or a kingdom, to build it up or to plant it,","tok":[{"t":"And at the moment that I "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[1]},{"t":" about a "},{"t":"nation","s":["H1471"],"a":[3]},{"t":" or a "},{"t":"kingdom","s":["H4467"],"a":[5]},{"t":", to "},{"t":"build","s":["H1129"],"a":[6]},{"t":" it up or to "},{"t":"plant","s":["H5193"],"a":[7]},{"t":" it,"}]},{"n":10,"text":"And if it does evil in My sight by not listening to My voice, then I will repent of the good with which I said I would benefit it.","tok":[{"t":"And if it does "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in My "},{"t":"sight","s":["H5869"],"a":[2]},{"t":" by not listening to My "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[5]},{"t":", then I will "},{"t":"repent","s":["H5162"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[8]},{"t":" with which I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[10]},{"t":" I would "},{"t":"benefit","s":["H3190"],"a":[11]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":11,"text":"And now speak to the men of Judah and to the inhabitants of Jerusalem, saying, Thus says Jehovah, Look, I am forming evil against you and devising a plan against you. Return now, each one of you from his evil way, and amend your ways and your deeds.","tok":[{"t":"And now "},{"t":"speak","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"men","s":["H0376"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and to the "},{"t":"inhabitants","s":["H3427"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[8]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[9]},{"t":", Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[12]},{"t":", Look, I am forming "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[17]},{"t":" against you and "},{"t":"devising","s":["H2803"],"a":[18]},{"t":" a plan against you. "},{"t":"Return","s":["H7725"],"a":[21]},{"t":" now, each "},{"t":"one","s":["H0376"],"a":[23]},{"t":" of you from his "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[25]},{"t":" "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[24]},{"t":", and amend your "},{"t":"ways","s":["H1870"],"a":[27]},{"t":" and your deeds."}]},{"n":12,"text":"But they say, It is hopeless! For we will walk after our own devices and everyone will do according to the stubbornness of his evil heart.","tok":[{"t":"But they say, It is hopeless! For we will "},{"t":"walk","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"after","s":["H0310"],"a":[3]},{"t":" our own "},{"t":"devices","s":["H4284"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and everyone will "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[10]},{"t":" according to the stubbornness of his "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Therefore thus says Jehovah, Ask now among the nations, Who has heard such things? The virgin of Israel Has done a very horrible thing.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Ask","s":["H7592"],"a":[4]},{"t":" now among the nations, Who has "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[8]},{"t":" such things? The "},{"t":"virgin","s":["H1330"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[14]},{"t":" Has "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[11]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"very","s":["H3966"],"a":[12]},{"t":" horrible "},{"t":"thing","s":["H8186"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"Does the snow of Lebanon Leave the rock of the field? Or will the cold flowing waters Coming from afar be dried up?","tok":[{"t":"Does","s":["H5800"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"snow","s":["H7950"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Lebanon","s":["H3844"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Leave","s":["H5800"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"rock","s":["H6697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[2]},{"t":"? Or will the "},{"t":"cold","s":["H7119"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"flowing","s":["H5140"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[7]},{"t":" Coming from afar be dried up?"}]},{"n":15,"text":"But My people have forgotten Me; They burn incense to vanity, And they have been stumbled in their ways From the ancient paths To walk on bypaths, On a way which is not cast up,","tok":[{"t":"But My "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[2]},{"t":" have "},{"t":"forgotten","s":["H7911"],"a":[1]},{"t":" Me; They burn "},{"t":"incense","s":["H6999"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"vanity","s":["H7723"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And they have been "},{"t":"stumbled","s":["H3782"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in their "},{"t":"ways","s":["H1870"],"a":[6]},{"t":" From the "},{"t":"ancient","s":["H5769"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"paths","s":["H7635"],"a":[7]},{"t":" To "},{"t":"walk","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" on "},{"t":"bypaths","s":["H5410"],"a":[10]},{"t":", On a "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[11]},{"t":" which is not cast "},{"t":"up","s":["H5549"],"a":[13]},{"t":","}]},{"n":16,"text":"To make their land an astonishment, A thing to be hissed at forever. Everyone who passes by will be astonished And shake his head.","tok":[{"t":"To "},{"t":"make","s":["H7760"],"a":[0]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[1]},{"t":" an astonishment, A thing to be "},{"t":"hissed","s":["H8292"],"a":[3]},{"t":" at forever. Everyone who "},{"t":"passes","s":["H5674"],"a":[6]},{"t":" by will be "},{"t":"astonished","s":["H8074"],"a":[8]},{"t":" And shake his "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"Like the east wind I will scatter them Before the enemy; I will show them My back and not My face In the day of their calamity.","tok":[{"t":"Like","s":["H6327"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"east","s":["H6921"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wind","s":["H7307"],"a":[0]},{"t":" I will "},{"t":"scatter","s":["H6327"],"a":[2]},{"t":" them "},{"t":"Before","s":["H6440"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"enemy","s":["H0341"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; I will show them My "},{"t":"back","s":["H6203"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and not My "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[7]},{"t":" In the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of their "},{"t":"calamity","s":["H0343"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18